# AIFO (AIDLC) Migration Planning Document
## Release Compliance Tracker → AIFO Portal Migration

# Objective

This task is NOT to start implementation immediately.

The first objective is to perform a complete architectural analysis of both projects and produce a migration plan before modifying any code.

The existing Release Compliance Tracker project is feature-complete (or close to feature-complete) and contains significant business logic that must be preserved.

The target platform is the existing AIFO (AIDLC) portal.

The migration must preserve business functionality while adopting the AIFO architecture, technology stack, UI conventions, authentication model, and coding standards.

